  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ud13e78d2\" id=\"ud13e78d2\"><p data-lake-id=\"ua62efc40\" id=\"ua62efc40\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9fe01410\" id=\"u9fe01410\">以字符驱动模块编译进内核举例</span></p></blockquote><ol list=\"u93beb50a\"><li fid=\"u1d918672\" data-lake-id=\"ubdc446be\" id=\"ubdc446be\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1deb9027\" id=\"u1deb9027\">在kernel/drivers/char下创建hello文件夹</span></li><li fid=\"u1d918672\" data-lake-id=\"u235d1016\" id=\"u235d1016\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08b5c8e7\" id=\"u08b5c8e7\">在hello文件夹下添加hello.c文件,编写驱动代码,内容如下</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Clinux%2Fmodule.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Clinux%2Fkernel.h%3E%5Cnstatic%20int%20__init%20helloworld_init(void)%7B%20%2F%2F%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20printk(KERN_EMERG%20%5C%22helloworld_init%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%2F%2F%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E7%94%A8%20printk%20%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%20printf%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnstatic%20void%20__exit%20helloworld_exit(void)%7B%20%2F%2F%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20printk(KERN_EMERG%20%5C%22helloworld_exit%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnmodule_init(helloworld_init)%3B%20%2F%2F%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnmodule_exit(helloworld_exit)%3B%20%2F%2F%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5CnMODULE_LICENSE(%5C%22GPL%20v2%5C%22)%3B%20%2F%2F%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%20GPL%20%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%5CnMODULE_AUTHOR(%5C%22itcast%5C%22)%3B%20%2F%2F%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BvS62%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u5addbf41\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u3445cee1\" data-lake-id=\"u1e8ac1d8\" id=\"u1e8ac1d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc078fda\" id=\"udc078fda\">在hello目录下增加Kconfig文件,内容如下</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22config%20HELLO%5Cn%20%20tristate%20%5C%22hello%20world%5C%22%20%5Cn%20%20help%5Cn%20%20hello%20hello%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iaua8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"uf39e1505\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u2ccb920a\" data-lake-id=\"ucb7e988a\" id=\"ucb7e988a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u626fd19e\" id=\"u626fd19e\">在hello目录下增加Makefile文件,内容如下</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22obj-%24(CONFIG_HELLO)%2B%3Dhelloworld.o%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oGTPd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u378be306\" id=\"u378be306\"><code data-lake-id=\"u3006a8eb\" id=\"u3006a8eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11f36643\" id=\"u11f36643\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">obj-</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u74c7bc9a\" id=\"u74c7bc9a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">是内核构建系统中的一个变量前缀，表示“要编译进内核或模块的目标对象文件列表”。</span></p><ul list=\"u9e2469ff\"><li fid=\"u33dac3a0\" data-lake-id=\"u4f1827be\" id=\"u4f1827be\"><code data-lake-id=\"ubc74fca8\" id=\"ubc74fca8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u545642ea\" id=\"u545642ea\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">obj-y</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue6aafa50\" id=\"ue6aafa50\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：表示该对象文件会被</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc6c92562\" id=\"uc6c92562\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">编译进内核镜像（built-in）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u40027629\" id=\"u40027629\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u33dac3a0\" data-lake-id=\"uec08ace9\" id=\"uec08ace9\"><code data-lake-id=\"ueab9cdd9\" id=\"ueab9cdd9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92261cf0\" id=\"u92261cf0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">obj-m</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3a8301c6\" id=\"u3a8301c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：表示该对象文件会被</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue3610200\" id=\"ue3610200\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">编译成可加载模块（.ko 文件）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5f57aef6\" id=\"u5f57aef6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u33dac3a0\" data-lake-id=\"u6906525a\" id=\"u6906525a\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc8946512\" id=\"uc8946512\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d2d8622\" id=\"u3d2d8622\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">obj-n</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u68b46f4c\" id=\"u68b46f4c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 或未定义：表示</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua878982f\" id=\"ua878982f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">不编译</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua9611080\" id=\"ua9611080\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u31e620c1\" start=\"5\"><li fid=\"ue2b91ea3\" data-lake-id=\"u9056994a\" id=\"u9056994a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1377fec7\" id=\"u1377fec7\">在上一级目录</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf5599eaf\" id=\"uf5599eaf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2f09763\" id=\"ua2f09763\">kernel/drivers/char</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufe8ec6c8\" id=\"ufe8ec6c8\">下的Makefile,增加如下内容</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22obj-y%20%2B%3D%20hello%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k5Qf4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5041f131\" id=\"u5041f131\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F34933095%2F1739875729899-cfcae03e-d456-4118-8838-bf594a1cf3a5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf668f498-e5d0-4adc-acc2-e8851c2efad%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc43eeffe-79e1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A472%2C%22height%22%3A282%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_bl